      "writtenOn": "2020-05-18T09:12:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t want to do anything too complicated as this needs to go into rvc-dev really soon as it is blocking migration of framework-modules to java_sdk_library.\n\nFollow up https://r.android.com/1312794 does prevent references to a *.impl from crossing an APEX boundary.",
      "parentUuid": "bdcea804_99e6bbd2",
      "range": {
