      "message": "I didn\u0027t know that this is supposed to be cherry-picked to rvc-dev. The bug is not tagged with RVC-TL-triaged either. This topic is already quite big though...\n\nWhy do we need the migration to java_sdk_library in rvc-dev? It would be nice of course but I don\u0027t think it\u0027s a must. Perhaps I am missing something, so invited Anton as well.",
