      "writtenOn": "2020-05-18T09:54:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we strictly need it, but I think it would be nice: \n\n- We need to continue RVC trees for as long as partners build R images (probably a few years). Since we\u0027re planning on doing the java_sdk_library conversion, it\u0027d be nice to keep R as close to the future (S+) as possible (stubs naming, java_sdk_library_import prebuilts etc)\n\n- We need all these changes in mainline-prod, where we cannot yet submit stuff, so we want to keep submitting the build changes in rvc-dev until mainline-prod is open. (This should arguably happen soon).\n\nThat said, Paul, we could be a bit more rigorous testing the on-device effects of changes. We\u0027re expecting all of these to be noops, and we can verify that with Colin\u0027s presubmit diff script. Invoke with:\n\n    blaze run //experimental/users/ccross/compare_target_files:compare_target_files -- --workplan_id WORKPLAN_ID --whitelist_file google3/experimental/users/ccross/compare_target_files/props.whitelist\n\nIt\u0027ll tell you what artifacts changed on the builds of the workplan (the long ID treehugger comments on your CL).",
      "parentUuid": "d70b550d_4bf8255f",
      "range": {
